{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2022-04-21 06:00:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIR GROUP REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'SEATTLE , APRIL 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALASKA AIR GROUP (NYSE: ALK) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS FIRST QUARTER ENDING MARCH 31, 2022 AND PROVIDED OUTLOOK FOR THE SECOND QUARTER ENDING JUNE 30, 2022. "ALASKA HAS A PROVEN TRACK RECORD AND A RESILIENT BUSINESS MODEL THAT DELIVERS IN GOOD TIMES AND THROUGH CHALLENGING ONES.'}